%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A7_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: How do you know all that?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There is something like a ledger. Each Sustainer has recordings of any
      disruptions that are collected in that ledger.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Having an overview makes it simpler to manage the dimensions. I just happened
      to get my hands on it and saw that her reports have stopped appearing there.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Okay, so they manage all the universes or dimensions. Is there a difference?
      And what\u2019s all that got to do with me? I\u2019m not sure if I\u2019ll
      be able to do all that."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Dimensions and universes can be used synonymously but we can refer to all
      of them together as THE universe.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "As for how exactly the Sustainer executes their powers, I do not know
      enough about that. I think that\u2019s for you to find out. You have encountered
      the consequences of what happens when the balance has been disturbed."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But does the same not apply to us? I mean we met each other because we
      somehow ended up in this universe.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I was about to ask that same question.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We do find ourselves entangled in some of the consequences as well, like
      the earthquake and that some people are not from here like you and me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But {playerName} has experienced a lot more situations, especially ones
      that are unique to them.
    alternativeText: But they have experienced a lot more situations, especially
      ones that are unique to them.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That seems to hint at {playerName} being sought out by nature. It seems
      the universe will search for a Sustainer by itself in cases like these, when
      dimensions collide or overlap.
    alternativeText: That seems to hint at them being sought out by nature. It seems
      the universe will search for a Sustainer by itself in cases like these, when
      dimensions collide or overlap.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I understand somewhat now. I assume that\u2019s also why you guys came
      to my universe and not the other way around."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s true, there are other people in this room that are not from
      here. It seems we all gathered in here because of you."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, it seems you are at the center of all this chaos.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just when Ethan finished his sentence I hear murmurs going through the
      room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It seems like the earthquake has slowly stopped and now it\u2019s quiet
      outside."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I think the people are considering going out again soon. It\u2019s been
      quiet outside for a while now."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Right. I didn\u2019t even notice, I was so distracted by what Ethan was
      telling us."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I still have some trouble coming to terms with yet another block of shocking
      information.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "So in short, Ethan\u2019s saying that i am the successor to some kind
      of Sustainer that keeps the balance of all the dimensions that exist. And all
      the weird stuff that has been happening is due to the Sustainer failing to
      keep said balance. "
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "While I\u2019m still pondering all of that, the mass of people has begun
      to move up to the surface again."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Good, I think I was able to confirm my theory about you being the successor,
      so that\u2019s enough for me. For now, we should also get out."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Yes, seems like the earthquake is finally over for good. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I look at my phone screen and there is indeed a notification that says
      that it\u2019s safe for people to return home again."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Alright, let\u2019s all go home and get some rest."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph and I wave goodbye to Ethan and make our way out.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He was a weird one, but he did say some pretty interesting stuff. He could
      help u- I mean help you in the future as well, don\u2019t you think?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He was a weird one, but he did say some pretty interesting stuff. He could
      help u- I mean help you in the future as well, don\u2019t you think?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "He almost said \u201Cus\u201D. That was kinda cute. I wouldn\u2019t mind
      going on this journey with Aleph to be honest."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Yeah, but when Ethan returns to how he normally behaves, I think I\u2019d
      rather not see him if possible."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I remember how that supposed elf treated me before and feel the anger rise
      again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "No, don\u2019t think about him anymore. I just wanna go home right now.
      I\u2019m exhausted."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6dcfb490320ae8c4685c7f8b453f889a, type: 2}
